<!doctype lake><title>🦫 𝓡𝓮𝓯𝓲𝓷𝓮𝓶𝓮𝓷𝓽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="nDKqj" id="nDKqj" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua86ac825" id="ua86ac825">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="ued291191" id="ued291191"> 𝐃𝐀𝐏𝐎: 𝐀𝐧 𝐎𝐩𝐞𝐧-𝐒𝐨𝐮𝐫𝐜𝐞 𝐋𝐋𝐌 𝐑𝐞𝐢𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐜𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐋𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐒𝐲𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐦 𝐚𝐭 𝐒𝐜𝐚𝐥𝐞</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ue8add5e7" id="ue8add5e7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u79715e86" id="u79715e86">以 OpenAI 的 o1 和 DeepSeek 的 R1 为代表的测试时扩展（test-time scaling），正在推动大语言模型的深刻范式变革。测试时扩展支持更长的思维链推理，并激发复杂的推理行为，使模型在 AIME 和 Codeforces 等数学竞赛与编程任务中表现出更强的能力。推动这一变革的核心技术是大规模强化学习，它能够激发自我验证和迭代改进等复杂推理行为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc240a574" id="uc240a574"><strong><span data-lake-id="u262f463e" id="u262f463e">朴素的 GRPO 基线存在熵坍塌、奖励噪声和训练不稳定等若干关键问题。作者提出解耦裁剪与动态采样策略优化算法，并引入四项关键技术，以提升强化学习在长思维链场景中的表现</span></strong></p><ul list="u21a2dc84"><li fid="u79284554" data-lake-id="u15611010" id="u15611010"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3559ae7" id="ua3559ae7" style="color: #E4495B">提高裁剪上界（Clip-Higher）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u48d1eebb" id="u48d1eebb" style="color: #E4495B">：</span><span data-lake-id="u36c2a19d" id="u36c2a19d">提升系统的生成多样性，避免熵坍塌</span></li><li fid="u79284554" data-lake-id="u7b33159e" id="u7b33159e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ude0e3a98" id="ude0e3a98" style="color: #E4495B">动态采样（Dynamic Sampling）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uef14dd68" id="uef14dd68" style="color: #E4495B">：</span><span data-lake-id="u431b9060" id="u431b9060">提高训练效率和稳定性</span></li><li fid="u79284554" data-lake-id="u34b129bc" id="u34b129bc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3cb4491f" id="u3cb4491f" style="color: #E4495B">Token 级策略梯度损失（Token-Level Policy Gradient Loss）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u21272fae" id="u21272fae" style="color: #E4495B">：</span><span data-lake-id="ua709b17c" id="ua709b17c">在长思维链强化学习场景中发挥关键作用</span></li><li fid="u79284554" data-lake-id="uf8da9926" id="uf8da9926"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3bb9435" id="ua3bb9435" style="color: #E4495B">超长回答奖励塑形（Overlong Reward Shaping）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua481e377" id="ua481e377" style="color: #E4495B">：</span><span data-lake-id="ub3b68746" id="ub3b68746">减少奖励噪声，稳定训练过程</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="G5bN1" id="G5bN1" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u683d0e8e" id="u683d0e8e">🌈</span><span data-lake-id="u08cdc010" id="u08cdc010"> 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐲</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u38c4f13a" id="u38c4f13a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufd000754" id="ufd000754">PPO 引入用于策略优化的裁剪代理目标。通过裁剪操作将策略更新限制在旧策略的邻近区域内，PPO 能够稳定训练过程并提高样本效率。PPO 通过最大化以下目标来更新策略</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue5a233c2" id="ue5a233c2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BPPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2Co_%7B%5C%5Cleq%20t%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_t%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7B%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o_t%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7B%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_t%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7B%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o_t%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7B%3Ct%7D)%7D%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1ba3c9a72579ca7e29aec3b71fc4bf61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K6OXI%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3d511360"><li fid="ub0afcbd6" data-lake-id="u12de651d" id="u12de651d"><span data-lake-id="u3c003d89" id="u3c003d89">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(q%2Ca)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcded0170475baa79807951d7672a19d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GnnAs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua71942bd" id="ua71942bd">是来自数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5903f53f4f8c62f99df77e4e3ccbc4e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JgHXZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6a69b58" id="ue6a69b58">的问答对，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc57c5f0e31d8960d9406bb149fced9e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OmNxG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6851c97c" id="u6851c97c">为重要性采样比率的裁剪范围，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff83bb5178226fd8754417abdd0f5005.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SGPTy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u389c4ce7" id="u389c4ce7">为时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dzxis%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3549e06b" id="u3549e06b">处的优势估计值。给定价值函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yHpmv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub497d088" id="ub497d088">和奖励函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdd1caa3f2e1582dab2cf9bfdb21b7556.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c59WL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29a08cf8" id="u29a08cf8">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff83bb5178226fd8754417abdd0f5005.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lNpbd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7fc256d" id="ua7fc256d"> 通过广义优势估计计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua5e872fe" id="ua5e872fe" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGAE%7D(%5C%5Cgamma%2C%5C%5Clambda)%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bl%3D0%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cinfty%7D(%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Clambda)%5El%5C%5Cdelta_%7Bt%2Bl%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f98853d17398412faf4f998acd0a726.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Gi1SU%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue683767d" id="ue683767d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta_l%3DR_l%2B%5C%5Cgamma%20V(s_%7Bl%2B1%7D)-V(s_l)%2C%5C%5Cquad%200%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cgamma%2C%5C%5Clambda%5C%5Cleq%201.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4875f396c66ffff0181732557425bbf3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XjJ0p%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufb0cc2d6" id="ufb0cc2d6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f11a7cb" id="u7f11a7cb" style="color: #101E60">GRPO 不再需要价值函数，而是以组内相对方式估计优势。对于给定的问答对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(q%2Ca)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcded0170475baa79807951d7672a19d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TdanE%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u775bd07b" id="u775bd07b" style="color: #101E60">，行为策略</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F619756aa1fc9995330d2f111c852dc8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nUBM1%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua5c5714b" id="ua5c5714b" style="color: #101E60">采样生成一组包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8df64a4bfdeb9bdcbc357668b6fb123.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rhh5T%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u38db3ac3" id="u38db3ac3" style="color: #101E60">个回答的集合</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2cd2bf1d9bb56a5b2400a05e2fa121.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JemYn%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud5201214" id="ud5201214" style="color: #101E60">。随后，通过对组内奖励</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BR_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5ec0ee5c2b3113c37e459a53a477496.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DyOuA%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u520a9ef6" id="u520a9ef6" style="color: #101E60">进行标准化，计算第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k1sQA%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5de4e16d" id="u5de4e16d" style="color: #101E60">个回答的优势</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5e7f6050" id="u5e7f6050" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Br_i-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bmean%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bstd%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D)%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffaabdec6942d4e0b7b5cc79a82bd349b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kq6a2%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub433533b"><li fid="uec4cd6ae" data-lake-id="u092dcd51" id="u092dcd51"><span data-lake-id="u3f00c81b" id="u3f00c81b">与 PPO 类似，GRPO 采用裁剪目标，并直接加入 KL 惩罚项：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u97597d04" id="u97597d04" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)-%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd609bc96101d409dbec6d53d4364ef49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BuiBL%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u182b411b" id="u182b411b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40f1d50f04bf115f8e6a5c20814caa8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ztsUX%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u63c6ec3c"><li fid="u6373a66f" data-lake-id="u3a9875b5" id="u3a9875b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e87c40d" id="u3e87c40d">GRPO 在样本级别计算优化目标。具体而言，GRPO 首先计算每条生成序列内部的平均损失，再对不同样本的损失取平均</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u324cf0e3" id="u324cf0e3"><strong><span data-lake-id="uad2e58d5" id="uad2e58d5" style="color: #5C0036">KL 惩罚项用于约束在线策略与冻结的参考策略之间的偏离程度。在 RLHF 场景中，强化学习的目标是对齐模型行为，同时避免模型过度偏离初始模型。然而，在训练长思维链推理模型时，模型分布可能显著偏离初始模型，因此这一约束并非必要</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u8c956b3e" id="u8c956b3e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3f81d224" id="u3f81d224">使用奖励模型通常会面临奖励投机问题：直接将可验证任务中最终答案的正确性作为结果奖励</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u76fc2767" id="u76fc2767" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R(%5C%5Chat%7By%7D%2Cy)%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D1%2C%26%5C%5Ctexttt%7Bis%5C%5C_equivalent%7D(%5C%5Chat%7By%7D%2Cy)%5C%5C%5C%5C-1%2C%26%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf57b2a733b473f4d373401feadab8f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JnRt4%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="ziIzQ" id="ziIzQ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1cfa49a9" id="u1cfa49a9">🍎</span><span data-lake-id="u6b67fab1" id="u6b67fab1"> 𝐃𝐞𝐜𝐨𝐮𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐂𝐥𝐢𝐩 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐃𝐲𝐧𝐚𝐦𝐢𝐜 𝐬𝐀𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u7ea4cba7" id="u7ea4cba7"><span data-lake-id="u4ce51ddf" id="u4ce51ddf">解耦裁剪与动态采样策略优化算法：对于每个与答案</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26fdbf8e53cb0e48da5f4ddd4aaf5a5c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WrdO9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5db3a39f" id="u5db3a39f">配对的问题</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MC1zy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u316a2cd0" id="u316a2cd0">，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a0a8c06" id="u9a0a8c06">DAPO</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubdd92023" id="ubdd92023"> 采样生成一组输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2cd2bf1d9bb56a5b2400a05e2fa121.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mucew%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u00470b4b" id="u00470b4b">，并通过以下目标优化策略</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud9c6e3ce" id="ud9c6e3ce" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDAPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blow%7D%7D%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhigh%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%260%3C%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Ctexttt%7Bis%5C%5C_equivalent%7D(a%2Co_i)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Cright%7C%3CG%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb95a2a8cfa43c57d60dfefed1bd4aa08.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LA24H%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3e406f83" id="u3e406f83" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7BR_i-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bmean%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bstd%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D)%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b227693d6f39562a6f384e4ce2dcec0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BQ17U%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub8b7f514" id="ub8b7f514"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5d634cf7" id="u5d634cf7" style="color: #70000D">在最初采用朴素 PPO 或 GRPO 的实验中，作者观察到熵坍塌现象：随着训练推进，策略的熵迅速下降。某些组内采样得到的回答趋于高度一致。这表明模型的探索受到限制，策略过早趋于确定性，从而可能阻碍训练规模的扩展</span></strong></p><ul list="u4acab3df"><li fid="u90afc6ae" data-lake-id="u1f7da7ec" id="u1f7da7ec"><span data-lake-id="u3ebb32b3" id="u3ebb32b3">提出 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u49d01e76" id="u49d01e76">Clip-Higher</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u46720eaf" id="u46720eaf"> 策略。裁剪近端策略优化通过对重要性采样比率进行裁剪来约束信赖域，从而增强强化学习的稳定性</span></li><li fid="u90afc6ae" data-lake-id="u53093bb4" id="u53093bb4"><span data-lake-id="u2d9d8c6d" id="u2d9d8c6d">裁剪上界可能限制策略的探索：提高利用型 token 的概率相对容易，而低概率探索型 token 的概率提升却受到过于严格的约束</span></li><li fid="u90afc6ae" data-lake-id="u6f2069cd" id="u6f2069cd"><span data-lake-id="uc78b3be4" id="uc78b3be4">按照 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u99a1e9da" id="u99a1e9da">Clip-Higher</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc3531f20" id="uc3531f20"> 策略，将裁剪范围的下界参数与上界参数解耦，分别记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blow%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff3ac5e599a099ddb3c3ac5e4d24cbdd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tXjFn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4a1832b" id="ud4a1832b">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhigh%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fea2de2daf1e509ea35b73e5e728f7b7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xZxTL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc369994e" id="uc369994e">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf144d032" id="uf144d032" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDAPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blow%7D%7D%7D%2C1%2B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhigh%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%260%3C%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Ctexttt%7Bis%5C%5C_equivalent%7D(a%2Co_i)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Cright%7C%3CG.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21561d9276e5cdcc48b9bee95c550a51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Oi6sd%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1b116cd7" id="u1b116cd7"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub8deb2f7" id="ub8deb2f7" style="color: #70000D">当某些提示对应的准确率达到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AVPNO%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufaf48939" id="ufaf48939" style="color: #70000D">时，现有强化学习算法会面临梯度减弱的问题。以 GRPO 为例，如果某个提示的所有输出</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2cd2bf1d9bb56a5b2400a05e2fa121.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uKHUg%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubcecfe46" id="ubcecfe46" style="color: #70000D">均正确，并获得相同的奖励，那么该组的优势就会为零。零优势会产生零策略梯度，从而减小批次梯度的幅度，并提高其对噪声的敏感性，最终降低样本效率</span></strong></p><ul list="u4741fc46"><li fid="u69e82e89" data-lake-id="u90a8b706" id="u90a8b706"><span data-lake-id="ua7f9de90" id="ua7f9de90">意味着每个批次中的有效提示数量不断减少，可能导致更大的梯度方差，并削弱模型训练的梯度信号</span></li><li fid="u69e82e89" data-lake-id="uaca548c5" id="uaca548c5"><span data-lake-id="ud44caac2" id="ud44caac2">提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u73acd027" id="u73acd027">过采样，并过滤准确率为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vLraq%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub97903bb" id="ub97903bb">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d0feea96d3bb2fc273f7598ce748c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GAzbu%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f5b615f" id="u7f5b615f">的提示</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u473a31ed" id="u473a31ed">。这样既能确保批次中的所有提示都提供有效梯度，也能保持提示数量一致。每个批次的采样成本是动态变化的。在进行训练之前持续采样，直到整个批次被准确率既不为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d0feea96d3bb2fc273f7598ce748c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hSWlr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u667795ce" id="u667795ce">、也不为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SnKwr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e0a6fe8" id="u5e0a6fe8">的样本填满</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue31a0b9d" id="ue31a0b9d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDAPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blow%7D%7D%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhigh%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%26%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D0%3C%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Ctexttt%7Bis%5C%5C_equivalent%7D(a%2Co_i)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Cright%7C%3CG%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86c0e637b70a4d59ef08bf0833ce9b33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rubPJ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub7105b23"><li fid="ucbfa408e" data-lake-id="ua34b4633" id="ua34b4633"><span data-lake-id="uf8371168" id="uf8371168">这一策略并不一定会降低训练效率，因为当强化学习系统采用同步执行方式，且生成阶段未采用流水线时，生成耗时通常由长尾样本的生成过程所主导</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2b7a8e43" id="u2b7a8e43"><strong><span data-lake-id="u74026d0c" id="u74026d0c" style="color: #70000D">原始 GRPO 算法采用样本级损失计算方式：首先对每个样本内部各 token 的损失取平均，再对不同样本的损失进行聚合。在这种方式下，每个样本在最终损失计算中具有相同的权重。这种损失归约方式在长思维链强化学习场景中会带来若干挑战</span></strong></p><ul list="u0e230b85"><li fid="uffd17ef8" data-lake-id="u250687d6" id="u250687d6"><span data-lake-id="u904ea7b3" id="u904ea7b3">由于所有样本在损失计算中被赋予相同的权重，较长回答中的 token 对总体损失的贡献可能被不成比例地降低，从而产生不利影响</span></li><li fid="uffd17ef8" data-lake-id="u6aa95802" id="u6aa95802"><span data-lake-id="u1bd46de3" id="u1bd46de3">首先，对于高质量的长样本，这种效应可能妨碍模型学习其中与推理相关的模式。其次，过长的样本往往包含乱码和重复词语等低质量模式。因此，样本级损失计算无法有效惩罚长样本中的这些不良模式，进而导致熵和回答长度的不合理增长</span></li><li fid="uffd17ef8" data-lake-id="u937fb928" id="u937fb928"><span data-lake-id="ub405c5d5" id="ub405c5d5">为解决上述局限，在长思维链强化学习场景中引入 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue0f47739" id="ue0f47739">Token 级策略梯度损失</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4e35f706" id="u4e35f706">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue3557d4b" id="ue3557d4b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDAPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%7Co_i%7C%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blow%7D%7D%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhigh%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%260%3C%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Ctexttt%7Bis%5C%5C_equivalent%7D(a%2Co_i)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Cright%7C%3CG.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc62990fad1125f2c8f6463ffff7d6789.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ejJR7%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3515807e"><li fid="u8c8b1a61" data-lake-id="ua5cde794" id="ua5cde794"><span data-lake-id="u31d86659" id="u31d86659">在这一设置下，相较于较短序列，较长序列能够对整体梯度更新产生更大的影响。此外，从单个 token 的角度来看，如果某种生成模式会导致奖励增加或减少，那么无论它出现在多长的回答中，都会受到同等程度的强化或抑制</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u13fecc2b" id="u13fecc2b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6308c424" id="u6308c424" style="color: #70000D">在强化学习训练中，通常会设置最大生成长度，并据此截断超长样本。对截断样本进行不恰当的奖励塑形可能引入奖励噪声，并严重干扰训练过程</span></strong></p><ul list="ub0b4ea9b"><li fid="u7705c559" data-lake-id="u586e327b" id="u586e327b"><span data-lake-id="u31b12b60" id="u31b12b60">默认情况下，会对截断样本赋予惩罚性奖励。然而，这种做法可能向训练过程引入噪声，因为一个合理的推理过程可能仅仅由于长度过长而受到惩罚。这类惩罚可能使模型对自身推理过程的有效性产生混淆</span></li><li fid="u7705c559" data-lake-id="u42a90205" id="u42a90205"><span data-lake-id="u1e8f2b9e" id="u1e8f2b9e">为研究这种奖励噪声的影响，首先采用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0b8e71a" id="uf0b8e71a">超长样本过滤</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ueec1b584" id="ueec1b584">策略，屏蔽截断样本的损失。这一方法能够显著稳定训练并提升性能</span></li><li fid="u7705c559" data-lake-id="ueb293767" id="ueb293767"><span data-lake-id="u130c0ec1" id="u130c0ec1">进一步提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u94151d87" id="u94151d87">软性超长惩罚</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5600e8d3" id="u5600e8d3">。这是一种长度感知的惩罚机制，旨在对截断样本的奖励进行塑形。当回答长度超过预先设定的最大值时，定义一个惩罚区间。在该区间内，回答越长，受到的惩罚就越大。该惩罚会叠加到原有的基于规则的正确性奖励上，从而向模型传递避免生成过长回答的信号</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2ef45293" id="u2ef45293" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blength%7D%7D(y)%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D0%2C%26%7Cy%7C%5C%5Cleq%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcache%7D%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cfrac%7B(L_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcache%7D%7D)-%7Cy%7C%7D%7BL_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcache%7D%7D%7D%2C%26L_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcache%7D%7D%3C%7Cy%7C%5C%5Cleq%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb308ff1a29df3e32093fcbfb10af0145.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zAYbd%22%7D"></card></p>